      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 475: 🔴 The output callback does not verify that its `codec` is still the current `videoParams.mediaCodec`. During a close/reopen, queued output from the old encoder can run after the new encoder has reset `codecData` and `encodedPacketBuffer`, causing stale frames/configuration to be sent into the new stream and shared state to be overwritten. Capture the codec/generation for the callback and drop stale output before processing it, still releasing that output buffer.",
      "revId": "054e63c48ae18e5ed8acd6d1378c30c84eeb9018",
