      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 883: 🔴 This resets `codecStarted` only when the new encoder succeeds. If `openEncoder()` fails and the code falls back to `ImageReader`, the previous `mediaCodec` and its `codecStarted` state can remain in `VideoParams`. `startCodec()` then sees and starts/reuses that stale codec even though the capture request targets the fallback surface, which can stall video. Clear the old codec state on the fallback path (with identity-safe teardown of the old codec).",
      "revId": "054e63c48ae18e5ed8acd6d1378c30c84eeb9018",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
